; Website: https://tilde.town/~kasasagi/
; Downloads: https://drive.proton.me/urls/PDERG8YN00#RwM3MVN730fv

;========================================================
;
; A ghostly park at night.
;
; Stage from the game Samurai Shodown IV by SNK-Playmore.
;
; M.U.G.E.N. adaptation by R.o.q.u.e.
;
; Special thanks to :
;  - SNK-Playmore for the Samurai Shodown series
;  - Mr K, for WinKawaks
;  - Corel, for Paint Shop Pro
;  - Sés, for M.C.M.
;  - Christophe and Winane, for SFFExtract
;  - Elecbyte, for Sprmaker
;
; For more M.U.G.E.N. material, visit the website : http://alice-games.org
;
; Notes :
; - In the original game, the stage is named Arie.
; - A variant of this stage (without the castle in the background) is used is Samurai Shodown V
; as Rasetsumaru's stage.
;
;========================================================

;--------------------------------------------------------

